    {
      "entryId": "phm-1-18",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The imputation sentence in a postcard. First principle: the gospel in miniature — debts transferred to the intercessor; Christ's account absorbs ours, and Paul practices it.",
