    {
      "entryId": "phm-1-6",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Effective faith acknowledges every good thing in us in Christ. First principle: faith communicates by acknowledging — the recognition of what is in Christ energizes the sharing.",
